Package: zunpy
Title: Read and Write 'NumPy' Array Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Read and write the array files of 'NumPy', '.npy' for one
    array and '.npz' for a 'ZIP' archive of them, to and from R vectors,
    matrices, arrays and data frames, without 'Python'. Numeric, boolean,
    complex, half-precision, string, date-time and structured types are
    supported. Every header is parsed and checked against the bytes present
    before anything is allocated, and every value is converted exactly or
    refused; writing is deterministic and matches the output of 'NumPy'.
